    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc10dd4073af8b09f41534e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对赛马娘的爱正是她的力量来源。\n在赛前遭遇到的巨大悲伤，\n如今成了爱丽数码最强的王牌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "696e2adb481b831b0edd9911f4970d1015abe70eca99580827081dc8c084f25c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
